All dataset files in this directory — the headline file cratesbump.csv.gz, the
uncapped extractor output cratesbump_extracted.csv.gz, and the earlier versions
compliant_dataset.csv.gz, compliant_dataset_v2_cargo.csv.gz and
compliant_dataset_v3_rebuilt_cargo.csv.gz — are licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International License.

